sequenceDiagram
    title 平台到最终 Wiki 落库时序图（W-06 / W-07）
    autonumber
    actor Caller as 业务应用 / Agent / CLI / MCP
    box rgb(248,250,252) 开放平台
        participant SDK as ikc-open-platform-sdk<br/>OpenPlatformClient.wiki
        participant Platform as ikc-open-platform<br/>北向 API / W-06
    end
    box rgb(239,246,255) 实例 core
        participant CSDK as ikc-core-sdk<br/>AsyncIkCCoreClient
        participant Core as ikc-core-service<br/>WikiBuildService
        participant CoreInt as /internal/wiki/build<br/>WikiWriteService
        participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>wiki_page / wiki_page_version
        participant Gov as review_flow / audit_log
    end
    box rgb(255,247,237) Wiki 引擎
        participant EngAPI as openwiki-server<br/>HTTP API
        participant EngSvc as OpenWikiService
        participant Kernel as OpenWiki 内核 / OKF<br/>Node CLI / 规则切页
        participant EngDB as 引擎 SQLite<br/>wikis / pages / jobs
        participant MQ as Redis / Celery
        participant Worker as openwiki worker
        participant WB as core_writeback<br/>回写适配器
    end

    Caller->>SDK: wiki.build(kbId, docId, markdown, wikiConfig, async?)
    SDK->>Platform: POST /api/v1/knowledge-bases/{kbId}/wiki/build<br/>Bearer + X-Request-Id
    Note over Platform: AuthN + AUTHZ(write kb)<br/>解析实例 + 补 23 位 traceId
    Platform->>CSDK: forward_request(...)
    CSDK->>Core: POST 同一路径 + 身份/追踪头
    Core->>Core: 校验 kb / doc / kbMode<br/>检查引擎配置
    Core->>EngAPI: GET /api/v1/wiki/wikis（ensure_resource）
    EngAPI-->>Core: wikiId
    Core->>EngAPI: POST /api/v1/wiki/wikis/{wikiId}/build
    EngAPI->>EngSvc: build_from_doc(docId, markdown, wikiConfig)
    EngSvc->>Kernel: openwiki / OKF / 规则切页
    Kernel-->>EngSvc: pages[]：stableKey/title/markdown/fields/links
    Note over EngSvc,WB: 双方按 ikc-sdk-lib 契约派生 wiki_ / page_ 稳定 ID
    EngSvc->>EngDB: UPSERT pages + deprecate_doc_pages
    EngDB-->>EngSvc: pages saved
    EngSvc->>WB: write_pages(kbId, docId, pages, dedup, mode)
    WB->>CoreInt: POST /internal/wiki/build<br/>X-Internal-Token
    CoreInt->>CoreInt: validate_target + upsert_pages
    CoreInt->>PG: UPSERT wiki_page<br/>revision_no+1（内容变化时）<br/>content_state=draft<br/>INSERT wiki_page_version
    CoreInt->>Gov: audit_log(wiki.build.writeback)
    CoreInt-->>WB: landed counts
    WB-->>EngSvc: writeback {ok:true}
    EngSvc-->>EngAPI: result + writeback
    EngAPI-->>Core: 统一壳 data
    Core->>Gov: audit_log(wiki.build)
    Core-->>CSDK: 000000 + data
    CSDK-->>Platform: envelope
    Platform-->>SDK: 000000 + data
    SDK-->>Caller: WikiBuildResult<br/>created / updated / deprecated
    Note over PG: 最终权威落库：wiki_page + wiki_page_version<br/>引擎 SQLite 只是引擎侧视图，不是最终真相

    opt async=true（W-06 投递 / W-07 轮询；复用上面的构建与回写）
        Caller->>SDK: wiki.build(..., async=true)
        SDK->>Platform: POST .../wiki/build {"async": true}
        Platform->>CSDK: forward_request
        CSDK->>Core: POST ...
        Core->>EngAPI: POST .../wiki/build {"async": true}
        EngAPI->>EngSvc: submit_job("build", payload)
        EngSvc->>EngDB: INSERT job(status=pending)
        EngSvc->>MQ: send_task(openwiki_server.build, jobId)
        EngSvc-->>EngAPI: {jobId, status:pending}
        EngAPI-->>Core: job view
        Core-->>CSDK: job view
        CSDK-->>Platform: job view
        Platform-->>SDK: jobId
        SDK-->>Caller: WikiBuildJobView
        MQ->>Worker: 消费 build 任务
        Worker->>EngSvc: build_from_doc(...)
        Note over Worker,WB: 构建、引擎 SQLite UPSERT、core 回写与上方 10–21 步相同
        Worker->>EngDB: update_job(success, result)
        Caller->>SDK: wiki.job(kbId, jobId)
        SDK->>Platform: GET .../wiki/jobs/{jobId}
        Platform->>CSDK: forward_request
        CSDK->>Core: GET ...
        Core->>EngAPI: GET /api/v1/wiki/jobs/{jobId}
        EngAPI->>EngSvc: get_job(jobId)
        EngSvc->>EngDB: SELECT job
        EngDB-->>EngSvc: status + result
        EngSvc-->>EngAPI: job view
        EngAPI-->>Core: job view
        Core-->>CSDK: job view
        CSDK-->>Platform: job view
        Platform-->>SDK: job view
        SDK-->>Caller: status=success
    end

    opt 发布生效（治理审核）
        Note over CoreInt,Gov: 落库后 content_state=draft<br/>审核：draft→reviewing→published<br/>结果落 review_flow(wiki_publish) + audit_log
    end

    Note over Core,EngAPI: core→engine 使用 BuildEngineClient(httpx)；<br/>openwiki-server-sdk 是引擎独立接入 SDK，不在本主链
